Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?perf(fields):=20quiet-latch=20idle=20fields=20w?=
 =?UTF-8?q?hen=20no=20NPC=20field=20roles=20(~2.6=C3=97)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Quiet idle still paid cadenced NPC discover + empty publish every tick
with no cone/deployed/anchored/npc/skim and an empty kernel. Latch when
idle and no awake scavenger/sweeper/salvor/anchor roles; wake on
entity-index membership, 0.5s rescan, or leaving idle. Soft-GPU fps not
claimed.
---
